 95	
 96	**Paths walked:**
 97	
 98	- `RaffleFactory.constructor` → input/code/decimal/destination validation → `new Raffle(quoteToken_, vrfWrapper_)` → single assignment to immutable `raffleImplementation` (`RaffleFactory.sol:L65-L92`). Every exceptional branch reverts factory construction; a successfully deployed factory has the constructor-created implementation.
