103	- Caller and alternative-path review: `IRaffleFactory` exposes one state-changing creation function (`IRaffleFactory.sol:L99-L104`), and `RaffleFactory` contains one implementation of it (`RaffleFactory.sol:L97-L148`). No other production function invokes a clone/deployment API.
